{"step_index":52,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T09:47:52Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-14T15:17:52+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-14T15:17:56+05:30\nThe search for \"\"Apple India\" education pricing \"MacBook Pro\" student discount back to school 2026\" returned the following summary:\nThe Apple \"Back to School\" 2026 promotion in India took place from **July 16, 2026, to September 24, 2026** (with some sources noting a primary promotional window ending August 27, 2026).\n\n### **Key Details of the 2026 Offer**\n*   **Eligible Products:** The promotion applied to select Mac models, including the **MacBook Pro** and MacBook Air.\n*   **The Offer:** Qualified purchasers who bought an eligible Mac during the promotional period received a discount on the product along with a promotional gift, such as **AirPods** or an eligible accessory.\n*   **Savings:** For MacBook Pro purchases, customers were eligible for promotional savings (reported as up to ₹12,900 off) plus the bundled promotional product.\n\n### **Eligibility and Verification**\n*   **Who Qualifies:** The offer was open to verified college students (current and newly accepted), parents of tertiary education students, and teachers/academic staff across all educational tiers.\n*   **Verification:** To avail of the education pricing, users were required to verify their student or faculty status. This could be done:\n    *   **Online:** Via the UNiDAYS verification process when signing in with an Apple Account on the Apple Education Store.\n    *   **In-Store:** By visiting an Apple retail store (such as Apple BKC or Apple Saket) and presenting a valid student ID, acceptance letter, or other proof of enrollment.\n\n### **How to Purchase**\n*   **Channels:** The promotion was available via the Apple Store for Education, physical Apple Store locations, and by calling Apple support.\n*   **Status:** As of mid-September 2026, the promotion period is nearing its conclusion (ending September 24, 2026). If you are looking to purchase, ensure you complete your transaction before the end date and have your verification documents ready.\n\n*Note: Always check the official [Apple India Education Store](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/education/back-to-school) for the most current terms, as specific configurations or accessory bundles may change or expire.*"}
{"step_index":53,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T09:47:56Z","thinking":"Considering the prompt, it requires a comprehensive search for Apple resellers in India. The task demands finding both APRs and authorized resellers with online stores and clearance deals on MacBook Pros. The intention is to gather specific information on each reseller: website URL, student pricing, clearance sections, and current discounts.\n\n\nExamining the provided list of potential resellers. Beginning with Aptronix, verifying if the website contains deals, student pricing, and specific MacBook Pro model discounts. Identified an \"Offers\" section and a student program page. Need to confirm specific MacBook Pro models and prices listed on the site.\n\nNext, I'll move on to Imagine Store, checking their website for similar information on deals, education pricing, and available MacBook Pro models with associated costs. The aim is to systematically gather the required details for each listed reseller. I'll need to scrutinize the websites for relevant sections.\n\n\nExamined the details for Aptronix and Imagine Store, noting specifics on student discounts, MacBook Pro models, and pricing from each website. Data collected includes regular prices, discounted prices, and applicable bank cashback details. Focusing now on capturing the essence of each reseller's offers in a structured format.\n\n\nImagine Store offers education pricing, which is stackable with bank cashback and No-Cost EMI options for MacBook Pros. Unicorn Store provides a 6% discount on current MacBook Pro models, along with \"Hot Deals\" for older models with up to 35% off. iPlanet features instant cashback on MacBook Pro purchases and exchange bonuses. iVenus is the last store to be analyzed.\n\n\niVenus offers student discounts and various deals, including \"Hot Deals\" and open-box options for older MacBook models, along with education discounts, bank cashback, and trade-in bonuses on specific configurations. FutureWorld India provides bank cashback, trade-in bonuses, and No-Cost EMI on MacBook Pro 14\" and 16\" models, specifically through its \"Student Corner.\" iNvent Store provides dedicated student offers, including discounts on MacBook Pro models.\n\n\nExamining iTech's website, confirmed the existence of promotional offers, a clearance section, and a student discount portal requiring specific verification steps. Detailed information was found regarding MacBook Pro discounts ranging from 3% to 15% and potential bank cashback offers.\n\nNext, I analyzed iCrest's site, noting seasonal sales, a dedicated student discount page, and various MacBook Pro offers, including student discounts, bank cashback, exchange bonuses, and EMI options. Observed a structured process for verifying student eligibility.\n\n\nAnalyzing indiaistore.com, the platform aggregates numerous APRs and resellers, featuring cashback offers and student schemes for MacBook Pros, coupled with bank-specific promotions and trade-in bonuses. In contrast, Maple Store primarily focuses on certified pre-owned Apple devices, offering substantial discounts on these models. Although Maple Store has no dedicated student discount page, it provides buying advice for students.\n\n\niBerry is not an Apple Authorized Reseller. Reliance Digital, Croma, and Vijay Sales are major authorized resellers, each with distinct offers. The official Apple India Education Store provides student discounts and back-to-school promotions with bundled accessories.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"send_message","args":{"Message":"# Comprehensive Research Report: Apple Premium Resellers & Authorised Resellers in India (MacBook Pro Deals, Clearance & Student Offers)\n\n### Executive Summary\nThis research evaluates all major Apple Premium Resellers (APRs), Apple Premium Partners (APPs), and Apple Authorised Resellers (AARs) in India with active online storefronts. The evaluation focuses on:\n1. **Deals, Offers, or Clearance sections**\n2. **Student/Education pricing pages & Back-to-School programs**\n3. **MacBook Pro models on discount and pricing (in INR)**\n4. **Reseller status and verification requirements**\n\n---\n\n### Comparison Matrix of Resellers\n\n| Reseller / Store | Type / Region | Website URL | Deals / Clearance Section? | Student / Education Page? | Back-to-School / Student Offer? | MacBook Pro Pricing / Discounts |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Aptronix** | Apple Premium Partner (Pan-India) | [aptronixindia.com](https://www.aptronixindia.com) | **Yes** (Offers page & bank cashbacks) | **Yes** (\"Back to Cool\" portal) | **Yes** (Up to 8-10% off Mac + accessories + AppleCare) | 14\" MBP: ₹2,20,708 (MRP ₹2,39,900) + ₹15,000 bank cashback |\n| **Imagine (Tresor Systems)** | Apple Premium Partner (North/West) | [myimaginestore.com](https://www.myimaginestore.com) | **Yes** (Promotional Offers) | **Yes** (Dedicated Student Offer) | **Yes** (~7% edu discount + bank cashback) | 14\" MBP: Net effective ₹2,08,107 (MRP ₹2,39,900); 16\" MBP: ₹3,19,707 |\n| **Imagine (Ample Technologies)** | Apple Premium Partner (South/Online) | [imagineonline.store](https://www.imagineonline.store) | **Yes** (Offers & Timeless Tech Sale) | **Yes** (Student & Teacher Discounts) | **Yes** (Edu rates + bank cashback + EMI) | 14\" & 16\" MBP configurations with edu pricing + up to ₹15,000 cashback |\n| **Unicorn Store** | Apple Premium Partner (North/West) | [shop.unicornstore.in](https://shop.unicornstore.in) | **Yes** (**\"Hot Deals\"** clearance up to 35% off) | **Yes** (\"Built for Students\") | **Yes** (Student pricing + Cashify trade-in bonus) | 14\" & 16\" MBP: 6% direct off + bank cashback; Clearance units 25–35% off |\n| **iPlanet** | Apple Premium Partner (South India) | [iplanet.one](https://iplanet.one) | **Yes** (Seasonal sales & clearance) | **Yes** (Student/Teacher Discounts) | **Yes** (Documented edu savings + exchange bonus) | MBP 14\" & 16\": Instant cashback up to ₹15,000 + ₹10,000 trade-in bonus |\n| **iVenus** | Apple Premium Partner (Gujarat/Maha) | [ivenus.in](https://ivenus.in) | **Yes** (Hot Deals & Open Box) | **Yes** (Student Offers) | **Yes** (Class 9+ & college edu discounts) | MBP 14\"/16\": ~3%+ base edu discount + bank cashback + Open Box clearance |\n| **FutureWorld** | Apple Premium Reseller (Pan-India) | [futureworldindia.in](https://www.futureworldindia.in) | **Yes** (Offers tab) | **Yes** (Student Corner) | **Yes** (Student pricing via helpline/portal) | MBP 14\"/16\": Bank cashback up to ₹15,000 (ICICI/SBI/Axis) + exchange bonus |\n| **iNvent** | Apple Premium Partner (North/NCR/Blr) | [inventstore.in](https://www.inventstore.in) | **Yes** (Offers page) | **Yes** (Student Enquiry Form) | **Yes** (8% to 22% student discount campaigns) | MBP: Up to 22% off during student campaigns + ₹10,000 card cashback |\n| **iTech** | Apple Premium Reseller (East India) | [itechstore.co.in](https://itechstore.co.in) | **Yes** (Offers & Demo units) | **Yes** (5-step Student Portal) | **Yes** (3% to 15% discount on select Macs) | Select MBP configurations discounted; clearance/demo models based on pincode |\n| **iCrest** | Apple Authorised Reseller (North/East) | [icreststore.in](https://icreststore.in) | **Yes** (Seasonal & End-of-Season sales) | **Yes** (Apple Student Discount page) | **Yes** (Downloadable consent form + doc upload) | MBP models eligible for student discount + instant cashback + Loan Mela EMI |\n| **IndiaiStore** | Official Distributor Platform (Redington/Ingram) | [indiaistore.com](https://www.indiaistore.com) | **Yes** (Aggregated APR Offers & Calculator) | **Yes** (Central Back-to-School Hub) | **Yes** (National cashback schemes for APRs) | Up to ₹10,000–₹15,000 instant card cashback across 3,000+ reseller stores |\n| **Maple Store** | Apple Reseller / ASP (Mumbai/Maha) | [maplestore.in](https://maplestore.in) | **Yes** (Focus on **Certified Pre-Owned**) | **No** (Online store focused on pre-owned) | **No** (No new-device student portal online) | Certified Pre-owned MacBook Pros with 32-step inspection & limited warranty |\n| **Reliance Digital** | National Apple Authorised Reseller | [reliancedigital.in](https://www.reliancedigital.in) | **Yes** (Offers & Bank Discounts) | **No** (General student guide only) | **No** (No dedicated student ID portal) | MBP 14\"/16\": Instant cashback ₹5,000–₹15,000 + 6-month NCEMI |\n| **Croma** | National Apple Authorised Reseller | [croma.com](https://www.croma.com) | **Yes** (Offers tab on product page) | **No** (Included in general promotions) | **No** (No separate student portal) | Instant card discounts (HDFC/ICICI/Axis) + No-Cost EMI |\n| **Vijay Sales** | National Apple Authorised Reseller | [vijaysales.com](https://www.vijaysales.com) | **Yes** (Apple Days Sale) | **No** (Seasonal creator/student sales) | **No** (No verification portal) | Promotional price cuts during Apple Days + bank cashback + easy EMI |\n| **Apple India Official Education** | Direct Apple Store Online (*Benchmark*) | [apple.com/in/shop/education](https://www.apple.com/in-edu/shop) | **Yes** (Back to School Promotion) | **Yes** (UNiDAYS Verification) | **Yes** (Free AirPods/accessories + edu discount) | MacBook Pro: Up to ₹12,900 educational savings + free AirPods bundle |\n\n---\n\n### Detailed Reseller Breakdowns\n\n#### 1. Aptronix (Apple Premium Partner)\n*   **Website:** [aptronixindia.com](https://www.aptronixindia.com)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Offers promotional deals and bank offers on its product pages. Cancellation terms formally specify conditions for \"sale, clearance, or promotional offer\" items.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Features the **\"Back to Cool\"** student program at [portal.aptronixindia.com/student-form](https://portal.aptronixindia.com/student-form).\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:**\n    *   Flat 8% to 10% discount on MacBooks.\n    *   15% off third-party accessories and 5% off Apple accessories.\n    *   25% off Protect+ with AppleCare services.\n    *   Lifestyle and education vouchers worth up to ₹40,000.\n    *   Verification requires College ID and Aadhaar card.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:**\n    *   14-inch MacBook Pro: Listed at ₹2,20,708 (MRP ₹2,39,900; flat 8% store discount) + up to ₹15,000 instant cashback on select bank cards (bringing net effective cost to ~₹2,05,708).\n\n#### 2. Imagine Store – Tresor Systems (Apple Premium Partner)\n*   **Website:** [myimaginestore.com](https://www.myimaginestore.com)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Active promotional and student offers section.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Dedicated page at [myimaginestore.com/student-offer](https://www.myimaginestore.com/student-offer).\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Flat ~7% education discount on Mac models for verified students/teachers, stackable with partner bank cashback (Axis, ICICI, SBI). Verification via downloadable student consent form.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:**\n    *   14-inch MacBook Pro: MRP ₹2,39,900; Net Effective Price ₹2,08,107 (after 7% student discount + card cashback).\n    *   14-inch MacBook Pro (Higher Specs / Max): MRP ₹4,99,900; Offer Price ₹4,74,905 (~5% discount).\n    *   16-inch MacBook Pro: MRP ₹3,59,900; Net Effective Price ₹3,19,707.\n\n#### 3. Imagine Online – Ample Technologies (Apple Premium Partner)\n*   **Website:** [imagineonline.store](https://www.imagineonline.store)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Offers section hosting recurring promotional events such as the \"Timeless Tech Sale\" and seasonal campaigns.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Dedicated \"Student and Teacher Discounts\" portal.\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Tailored education pricing on eligible Mac configurations with college ID verification, combined with No-Cost EMI and bank cashbacks.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:** Up to ₹15,000 instant cashback on select bank credit cards + store education pricing on 14\" and 16\" MacBook Pro models.\n\n#### 4. Unicorn Store (Apple Premium Partner)\n*   **Website:** [shop.unicornstore.in](https://shop.unicornstore.in) / [unicornstore.in](https://unicornstore.in)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** **Yes – dedicated \"Hot Deals\" / \"UNi DealHot\" section**. This is one of the few APR stores with an explicit clearance section selling brand-new/sealed previous-generation MacBooks at steep discounts.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Features a \"Student Offer\" / \"Built for Students\" portal.\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Student discounts stackable with bank card cashback and Cashify trade-in bonuses.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:**\n    *   Current MacBook Pro 14\" & 16\" models: ~6% instant store discount + bank cashback (Axis, ICICI, SBI, HDFC).\n    *   Hot Deals Clearance: Older/previous-generation MacBook Pro models discounted between **25% to 35% off original MRP**.\n\n#### 5. iPlanet (Apple Premium Partner)\n*   **Website:** [iplanet.one](https://iplanet.one)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Offers & Deals section with festival/seasonal campaigns and exchange programs.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Dedicated Student & Teacher Discounts page.\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Requires valid Student ID / Teacher ID and supporting government ID. Offers base education discounts + trade-in bonuses.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:**\n    *   Up to ₹15,000 instant bank cashback on select MacBook Pro models.\n    *   Exchange bonus of up to ₹10,000 via Cashify.\n    *   Partner reward accruals (such as IndiGo BluChips).\n\n#### 6. iVenus (Apple Premium Partner)\n*   **Website:** [ivenus.in](https://ivenus.in)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Yes. Features \"Hot Deals\" and an **\"Open Box\"** section for discounted previous-generation devices.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. \"Student Offers\" section.\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Open to high school students (Class 9+), college students, and faculty members upon ID submission.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:** ~3%+ student discount + instant cashback with Axis/ICICI/SBI cards + trade-in bonus.\n\n#### 7. FutureWorld India (Apple Premium Reseller)\n*   **Website:** [futureworldindia.in](https://www.futureworldindia.in)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Yes, product-level offer listings and affordability options.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Dedicated **\"Student Corner\"** at [futureworldindia.in/student-corner](https://www.futureworldindia.in/student-corner).\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Special pricing and bundled offers available upon student credential verification.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:** Instant cashback up to ₹15,000 (ICICI, SBI, Axis), Cashify trade-in bonus, and No-Cost EMI plans.\n\n#### 8. iNvent Store (Apple Premium Partner)\n*   **Website:** [inventstore.in](https://www.inventstore.in)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Yes. \"Offers\" section with seasonal discounts.\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Dedicated \"Student Offer\" section with an interactive Student Enquiry Form.\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Student discount campaigns historically offering between 8% to 22% off on MacBooks with valid student ID.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:** Up to ₹10,000 instant cashback across ICICI, SBI, Axis, Kotak, and IDFC First Bank cards + up to ₹10,000 exchange bonus.\n\n#### 9. iTech (Apple Premium Reseller)\n*   **Website:** [itechstore.co.in](https://itechstore.co.in)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Clearance and demo stock listings (location/pincode dependent).\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Dedicated 5-step Student/Teacher verification portal requiring Student ID, government photo ID, and latest tuition fee receipt.\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** 3% to 15% discount on select Mac configurations.\n*   **MacBook Pro Deals & Pricing:** Direct discount applied following 24-hour verification.\n\n#### 10. iCrest (Apple Authorised Reseller)\n*   **Website:** [icreststore.in](https://icreststore.in)\n*   **Deals / Clearance Section:** Seasonal events (Black Friday, New Year, End-of-Season) and special financing promotions (\"Loan Mela\").\n*   **Student / Education Page:** Yes. Dedicated page at [icreststore.in/apple-student-discount-offers/](https://icreststore.in/apple-student-discount-offers/).\n*   **Student / Back-to-School Offers:** Verification via consent form and document upload (college ID / fee receipt / admission letter).\n\n#### 11. IndiaiStore (Aggregator Platform for Authorized APRs)\n*   **Website:** [indiaistore.com](https://www.indiaistore.com)\n*   **Role:** Official distributor platform (Redington & Ingram Micro) connecting 3,000+ reseller outlets.\n*   **Deals & Student Info:** Hosts official nationwide bank cashback campaigns (Axis, ICICI, SBI) offering ₹10,000 to ₹15,000 cashback, trade-in calculators, and links to local APR student events.\n\n#### 12. Clarifications on Specific Queries:\n*   **Maple Store ([maplestore.in](https://maplestore.in)):** While historically an Apple Premium Reseller in Mumbai, its online storefront is now focused on **Certified Pre-Owned Apple devices** (graded units with 32-step quality check and limited warranty) rather than brand-new inventory with education pricing.\n*   **iBerry ([iberryservice.in](https://iberryservice.in)):** iBerry is **NOT** an Apple Authorized Reseller or APR. It is an independent, non-authorized third-party repair provider based in Bengaluru.\n\n---\n\n### Key Recommendations for Maximum Savings\n1. **Best Clearance Deals on Brand-New Units:** Check **Unicorn Store's \"Hot Deals\"** section ([shop.unicornstore.in](https://shop.unicornstore.in)) for sealed previous-gen MacBook Pro models discounted by 25%–35%.\n2. **Best Documented Online Student Pricing:** **Imagine Store (Tresor Systems)** and **Aptronix** offer transparent online student discount portals (~7% to 10% base discount) that stack with ₹10,000–₹15,000 bank cashbacks.\n3. **Official Apple Education Alternative:** Apple India's official Back-to-School program ([apple.com/in-edu/shop](https://www.apple.com/in-edu/shop)) provides up to ₹12,900 off on MacBook Pro models along with complimentary AirPods bundles via UNiDAYS verification.","Recipient":"b764a5db-2187-47e2-b019-8f596935f002","toolAction":"Sending report","toolSummary":"Send report to parent"}}]}
